        "{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is Road Linx Transport?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Road Linx Transport is a Brisbane-based freight and transport company serving businesses across South East Queensland and Northern NSW, specialising in reliable, compliant freight from single pallets to full truck loads.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is Chain of Responsibility?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Chain of Responsibility, or COR, is the law that spreads legal responsibility for heavy-vehicle safety across everyone involved in the freight task, including the operator, loader and often the customer. We work to our COR obligations on every job.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are you NHVR compliant?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. We operate as an NHVR-compliant business, meeting the National Heavy Vehicle Regulator's safety and maintenance standards, with load-rated equipment and drivers trained in load restraint.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What does load-rated equipment mean?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Load-rated equipment has restraint systems engineered and certified to hold freight to a stated rating. It lets us secure loads correctly to that rating and turn them around faster, rather than improvising with general-purpose straps.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What is your ABN?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Road Linx Transport operates under ABN 25 387 822 327 and ACN 666 887 903. You can reach us on 07 3179 7072 or at admin@roadlinxtransport.com.au\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does using Road Linx help my own COR compliance?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Because we manage load restraint, driver fatigue and vehicle standards to our own COR obligations, using a compliant carrier supports your business in meeting its Chain of Responsibility duties as part of the freight task.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Where is Road Linx Transport based?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"We're based in Brisbane and run freight across South East Queensland and into Northern NSW, from the metro and the Port out to the coast, the Wide Bay, the Darling Downs and across the border.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What makes Road Linx different?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A focus on the things that decide whether freight arrives right: load-rated equipment, trained drivers, genuine compliance, quick turnarounds and one team accountable from pickup to delivery rather than a chain of subcontractors.\"}}]}"
